To request leave you must contact Tilt (GitLab’s third-party leave administrator). You can:  
- Access Tilt through your Okta account;  
- Email LeaveSupport@ourtilt.com;  
- Use Tilt’s contact form or text (970) 449-0178;  
- Schedule a call via a Leave Specialist (Tilt will send a scheduling link).  
For medical absences over 5 days you must report the absence to Tilt (Tilt will contact you within 24–48 business hours). For military leave you should also submit orders to Tilt when required.

